              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Changed from Screen 5 after review (inventory-59, owner 2026-10-21): a new first state for a call recorded while the final-pass model was still downloading; the pass waits and starts by itself. A failed pass names its cause and links to the log. The live text is as messy as the spike's output (ОКР, слог, repeats); the final text stays clean.",
