              "id": "FiuNX",
              "name": "Open",
              "fill": "#B4540A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Proposed, not decided: the cause wording (out of memory, model missing, decode error), and whether the summary thread starts by itself after the final pass. «Журнал ↗» opens the call's log; where that log lives is not set. The waiting bar here shows the download, not the pass.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
