              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Each call is a folder named yyyy.MM.dd-HHmm <title> (Amanu's scheme), and the title is that folder name without its timestamp (owner, 2026-10-21). A title starts as the call app's name («Zoom»); from v3 it is the name of a calendar event that overlaps the call. Click a title to rename it inline: the timestamp prefix stays fixed. Renaming the folder in Finder works too, and the list follows.",
