            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tEi1W",
              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "As Screen 3 v2, with two changes (owner, 2026-10-21; mvp.md on branch wisper). The app reads the explanation back (bb thread output) and shows it in the card, with «bb · тред ↗» for follow-up, so the «sent, no read-back» fallback is gone. New state: a call that starts while the live model downloads records audio and shows live text once the model arrives.",
