              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Required: nothing else opens until it is done. Models: Parakeet v3 is the live model, so it is a required line, not a choice; below it the final-pass engine is chosen, with no default. Each model says where it comes from: «есть», «есть · из Amanu» (reused only on an exact file match: name, size and checksum) or «↓ size» (the app downloads its own copy). Then the calls folder (visible, default ~/Recordings/wisper; settings and logs stay in ~/.wisper) and the permissions: microphone, call audio, and Calendar, optional and marked v3, which names a call after the event it overlaps. Continue waits only for an engine choice, never for a download: a call started before the live model arrives records audio, and live text starts once it is here.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
