              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Shown at launch, before any call, when the chosen final-pass engine's model is missing, with the real path of the missing file. A model reused from another app on an exact match (here Amanu's) can disappear when that app deletes it; the launch check catches it. Three ways out: download the app's own copy, choose another engine, or quit. While it downloads, recording is allowed and the final pass waits.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
