            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Lqmlc",
              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The Glass Ledger panel through a call. Speakers are words in the gutter: «я» is the mic track in teal, «они» the call track in amber. Start and stop sit in the header. Unconfirmed text is dim and is replaced in place when confirmed text arrives; live text is as messy as the spike's Parakeet output (ОКР, слог, repeats at chunk edges). A selection is anchored to its words, so appends below never move or drop it. ⌃⌥⌘E sends the selection to a bb thread; the card reports each step, and the explanation comes back from the thread's output, with «bb · тред ↗» for follow-up. A call that starts while the live model downloads records audio; once the model is here, the earlier minutes are filled in and marked «дописано позже».",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u7Uofk",
              "name": "Open",
              "fill": "#B4540A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Decided (agents, owner delegated, 2026-10-21; mvp.md): late-filled text is marked «дописано позже» and drawn dimmer. Still proposed: no hotkey for start/stop; the 4 s steps follow the default chunk size; «они» covers everyone on the call until remote speakers get names (Later in mvp.md). RACI was never spoken in the spike, so its spelling here is a guess.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
