              "name": "Idea",
              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Opened from Стоп or the calls list. The header shows the title (click to rename inline; the yyyy.MM.dd-HHmm prefix stays fixed), the call's folder in the visible ~/Recordings/wisper and its five files: meta.json, audio.m4a, raw.md, final.md, summary.md. Until the final pass ends, the live text is shown and labelled; a pass recorded during the model's download waits and starts by itself, and a failed pass names its cause and links to the log. The app writes summary.md itself from the bb thread's output and shows it above the transcript, with «bb · тред ↗» for follow-up.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
