              "content": "Decided (agents, owner delegated, 2026-10-21; mvp.md): the summary sits above the transcript, collapsed to 3–4 lines with «показать всё». Still proposed: the cause wording (out of memory, model missing, decode error); where the call's log lives (Журнал ↗).",
