              "fill": "#444444",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "One page, label column on the left: the calls folder (visible, default ~/Recordings/wisper; settings and logs stay in ~/.wisper), the final-pass engine (required), audio cleanup stated rather than set (7 days, pin to keep), the explain hotkey; chunk size only in debug builds. Changing the folder asks once with the count and size, then moves every call one by one (copy, check, delete the source): only Move or Cancel. No recording starts during a move and no move starts during a recording. A failed move names the count moved, the call that failed and why, offers Повторить, and keeps the old folder until every call has moved.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
